{title: 316 - Live Out Thy Life Within Me}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #316 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 316}
{meta: category Gospel - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Live out Thy [G/D]life [D]within [A7/G]me, [D/F#]O [G]Jesus, [D/A]King [A7]of [D]kings!
[A7/E]Be [F#m]Thou [D/F#]Thyself [F#m]the [A7/G]an [G]swer [A]to [Bm]all [A/C#]my [D]questionings;
[A]Live [D]out [A7/E]Thy [F#m]life [G]within [F#m]me, [Bm]in all things have Thy [Em]way!
[A/C#]I, [D]the transparent [G]med ium, Thy [Em]glory [A]to [A7]display.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]The temple [G/D]has [D]been yielded, And [G]purified [D/A]of [A7]sin;
[A7/E]Let [F#m]Thy [D/F#]Shekinah [A7/G]glory [A]Now [Bm]shine [A/C#]forth [D]from [Bm]within,
[A]And all [D]the [A7/E]earth [F#m]keep [G]silence, [F#m]The [Bm]body henceforth [Em]be
[A/C#]Thy [D]silent, [G/D]gentle servant, Moved [Em]only [A]as [A7]by [D]Thee.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D]Its members every moment Held [G]subject [D/A]to [A7]Thy [D]call,
[A7/E]Ready [D/F#]to have [F#m]Thee [A7/G]use [G]them, [A]Or [Bm]not [A/C#]be [D]used [Bm]at [A]all;
[A]Held [D]without [F#m]restless [G]longing, [Bm]Or strain, or stress, or [Em]fret
[A/C#]Or [D]chafings [G/D]at [D]Thy [G]dealings, Or [Em]thoughts of [A]vain [A7]regret.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[D]But restful, [G/D]calm, [D]and pliant, From [G]bend and [D/A]bias [A7]free,
[A7/E]Awaiting [D/F#]Thy [F#m]decision, [A]When [Bm]Thou [A/C#]hast [D]need [Bm]of [A]me.
[A]Live [D]out [A7/E]Thy [F#m]life [G]within [F#m]me, [Bm]O Jesus, King of [Em]kings!
[A/C#]Be [D]Thou the [G/D]glorious answer To [Em]all my [A]questionings.
{end_of_verse}
